  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Acquacotta builds from a simple "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "soffritto",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "soffritto"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " of onion and celery, then simmers tomatoes and stock until the soup is full of flavour. It serves 4 and the finishing touch is "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "poaching",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "poaching"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " an egg directly in the hot soup."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Each bowl is served over a slice of toasted bread, with the egg sitting on top. The yolk breaks and runs through the broth when you eat it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
